"services": "<template data-av-doc=\"asx\"><p class=\"av-story-modal__eyebrow\">PRESS · ASX APPOINTMENTS · 03 05 2013</p><h2 class=\"av-story-modal__title\">Director of Operations – Mongolian Resource Corporation</h2><div class=\"av-story-modal__text av-doc\"><p>The ASX appointments notice of 3 May 2013 (pages 13 &amp; 14) covers Krzysztof (Kris) Biegaj joining Mongolian Resource Corporation (ASX: MUB) as Director of Operations for the Sujigtei Gold Project in Mongolia.</p><h3>The role</h3><ul><li>Re-establish mining and processing operations for the recapitalised business</li><li>Liaise with government on permitting and operations</li><li>Develop operational strategy and planning, and the interface with the corporate team</li></ul><h3>Experience he brought</h3><ul><li>Executive Manager – Mining at AngloGold Ashanti’s Obuasi Gold Mine, Ghana (2009 – 2012)</li><li>Site Director, Nezhdaninskoye Gold Project, Far-East Siberia, Russia (2002 – 2003)</li><li>Mine Manager and Manager Mining roles with WMC Resources in Kambalda and Norseman, WA (1992 – 2002)</li><li>First Class Mine Manager’s Certificates of Competency (WA Metalliferous and Coal)</li></ul><p class=\"av-doc-note\">Summary of the notice. A copy of the original ASX pages will be added here soon.</p><div class=\"av-doc-actions\"><a class=\"av-doc-btn\" href=\"/contact/\">Request a copy</a></div></div></template><template data-av-doc=\"qa\"><p class=\"av-story-modal__eyebrow\">PRESS · Q&amp;A · 17 03 2012</p><h2 class=\"av-story-modal__title\">Ken Brinsden Q&amp;A – mention of Kris Biegaj</h2><div class=\"av-story-modal__text av-doc\"><p>This press clipping from 17 March 2012 is a Q&amp;A with Australian mining executive Ken Brinsden. The reference to Kris Biegaj appears at the top of the second column.</p><h3>Where Kris was at the time</h3><ul><li>Executive Manager – Mining / Manager Mine Projects at AngloGold Ashanti’s Obuasi Gold Mine in Ghana (2009 – 2012)</li><li>Leading a modernisation programme: revised organisational structure, a 12-hour continuous mining roster, upgraded surface and underground facilities, and tele-remote mucking in open stopes</li><li>About to move into business improvement and mining consulting with McMahon Mining Contractors and TransSiberian Gold (2012 – 2017)</li></ul><p class=\"av-doc-note\">Summary only. The original clipping will be added here soon.</p><div class=\"av-doc-actions\"><a class=\"av-doc-btn\" href=\"/contact/\">Request a copy</a></div></div></template><!-- PLACEHOLDER testimonials: replace with client-approved quotes before launch --><template data-av-doc=\"testimonials\"><p class=\"av-story-modal__eyebrow\">REFERENCES · TESTIMONIALS</p><h2 class=\"av-story-modal__title\">What clients and colleagues say</h2><div class=\"av-story-modal__text av-doc\"><div class=\"av-doc-quotes\"><figure class=\"av-doc-quote\"><blockquote>“The Mobile Supersucker cleaned our ore drive floors down to solid rock and recovered high-grade fines our loaders simply left behind. Kris ran it with two operators and the grades spoke for themselves.”</blockquote><figcaption><strong>Mine Manager</strong><span>Underground nickel operation, Western Australia</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"av-doc-quote\"><blockquote>“Kris brought a genuinely safety-first culture to site. His “Safety at Home” approach changed how our crews thought about risk, both underground and after shift.”</blockquote><figcaption><strong>Underground Superintendent</strong><span>Gold operation, Kambalda WA</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"av-doc-quote\"><blockquote>“His debottlenecking review gave us clear KPIs and a mine design we could actually deliver. Practical, hands-on and respected by the workforce.”</blockquote><figcaption><strong>Operations Director</strong><span>Mining contractor, Australia &amp; Asia</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"av-doc-quote\"><blockquote>“The move to a 12-hour continuous roster and the upgraded underground facilities lifted both productivity and morale. Kris listens to everyone, then gets it done.”</blockquote><figcaption><strong>Senior Mining Engineer</strong><span>Underground gold mine, West Africa</span></figcaption></figure></div><p class=\"av-doc-note\">Full references are available on request.</p><div class=\"av-doc-actions\"><a class=\"av-doc-btn\" href=\"/contact/\">Request references</a></div></div></template>",
"company": "<template data-av-doc=\"cv-ru\"><p class=\"av-story-modal__eyebrow\">РЕЗЮМЕ · РУССКАЯ ВЕРСИЯ</p><h2 class=\"av-story-modal__title\">Кшиштоф (Крис) Бегай – краткое резюме</h2><div class=\"av-story-modal__text av-doc\"><p>Руководитель горного производства, консультант по повышению эффективности и владелец бизнеса. Более 45 лет опыта подземной и открытой разработки в Австралии, России, Казахстане, Гане, Монголии и на Филиппинах. Основатель и директор компании Ausvac Mining Pty Ltd.</p><h3>Образование и квалификация</h3><ul><li>Горный инженер (диплом с отличием) – Вроцлавский технический университет, Польша</li><li>Сертификат управляющего рудником первого класса – Западная Австралия, металлические рудники</li><li>Сертификат управляющего рудником первого класса – Западная Австралия, угольные шахты</li><li>Член Австралазийского института горного дела и металлургии (AusIMM)</li></ul><h3>Основные этапы карьеры</h3><ul class=\"av-doc-timeline\"><li><b>2020 – н. в.</b> Специализированный горный подрядчик (владелец) – Ausvac Mining Pty Ltd, Перт</li><li><b>2016 – 2020</b> Управляющий рудником / руководитель проекта – Ramelius Resources, Маунт-Магнет</li><li><b>2012 – 2017</b> Консультант по повышению эффективности – McMahon Mining Contractors; TransSiberian Gold (Россия)</li><li><b>2013</b> Директор по производству – Mongolian Resource Corp, золоторудный проект Суджигтэй, Монголия</li><li><b>2009 – 2012</b> Исполнительный менеджер по горным работам – AngloGold Ashanti, рудник Обуаси, Гана</li><li><b>2004 – 2005</b> Консультант по производству – Celtic Resources, проект Суздаль, Казахстан</li><li><b>2002 – 2003</b> Директор рудника – Celtic Resources, Нежданинское месторождение, Дальний Восток России</li><li><b>1992 – 2002</b> Управляющий рудником / менеджер горных работ – WMC Resources, Камбалда и Норсмен</li></ul><h3>Языки</h3><p>Английский, польский, русский – свободно, устно и письменно.</p><p class=\"av-doc-note\">Полная версия резюме на русском языке будет добавлена в ближайшее время.</p><div class=\"av-doc-actions\"><a class=\"av-doc-btn\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/ausvac-docs/kris-biegaj-cv-english.docx\" download>Скачать резюме (англ., Word)</a><a class=\"av-doc-btn av-doc-btn--ghost\" href=\"/contact/\">Связаться</a></div></div></template><template data-av-doc=\"cv-pdf\"><p class=\"av-story-modal__eyebrow\">CURRICULUM VITAE · ENGLISH</p><h2 class=\"av-story-modal__title\">Krzysztof (Kris) Biegaj – CV summary</h2><div class=\"av-story-modal__text av-doc\"><p>Senior manager, business and operations consultant and business owner with 45+ years in underground and open pit mining across Australia, Russia, Kazakhstan, Ghana, Mongolia and the Philippines. Founder and Director of Ausvac Mining Pty Ltd.</p><h3>Qualifications</h3><ul><li>Bachelor of Engineering (Mining) Hons – Wroclaw Technical University, Poland</li><li>First Class Mine Manager’s Certificate of Competency – WA Metalliferous</li><li>First Class Mine Manager’s Certificate of Competency – WA Coal</li><li>Member of the Australasian Institute of Mining &amp; Metallurgy (AusIMM)</li></ul><h3>Career highlights</h3><ul class=\"av-doc-timeline\"><li><b>2020 – present</b> Specialist Mining Contractor (Owner) – Ausvac Mining Pty Ltd, Perth WA</li><li><b>2016 – 2020</b> Mine Manager / Project Manager – Ramelius Resources, Mt Magnet WA</li><li><b>2012 – 2017</b> Business Improvement / Mining Consultant – McMahon Mining Contractors; TransSiberian Gold</li><li><b>2013</b> Director of Operations – Mongolian Resource Corp, Sujigtei Gold Project</li><li><b>2009 – 2012</b> Executive Manager – Mining – AngloGold Ashanti, Obuasi Gold Mine, Ghana</li><li><b>2003 – 2004</b> Founded Ausvac Mining – designed and built the Mobile Supersucker, Kalgoorlie WA</li><li><b>2002 – 2003</b> Site Director – Celtic Resources, Nezhdaninskoye Gold Project, Russia</li><li><b>1992 – 2002</b> Mine Manager / Manager Mining – WMC Resources, Kambalda &amp; Norseman WA</li><li><b>1987 – 1992</b> District Inspector of Mines – WA Department of Minerals and Energy</li></ul><h3>Languages</h3><p>English, Polish and Russian – fluent, spoken and written.</p><p class=\"av-doc-note\">The print-ready PDF will be added here soon. The full CV is available as a Word document now.</p><div class=\"av-doc-actions\"><a class=\"av-doc-btn\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/ausvac-docs/kris-biegaj-cv-english.docx\" download>Download full CV (Word)</a><a class=\"av-doc-btn av-doc-btn--ghost\" href=\"/contact/\">Contact Kris</a></div></div></template>"
